_1101250761437363594_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dnsmaIju9gcQ7kNvwG8wGiD&_nc_oc=Ado5po9UD7df6lYRA9cxNA1lFFEChAL1t6iKXXjClLNqQokJFGQMvJr8bu224laIKQQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQoTJYTCTijd1ZwVUR-jXIG8RKxFlscVZaGEyMuga-EuA&oe=6AFC5F99"}, {"file_name": "META.png", "id": "2070325233659173", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_2070325236992506_3844765138067323773_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rZIzevcDiW0Q7kNvwFtZ2Vp&_nc_oc=AdpjVsehPquSywOD8b3uDHrgoU4vOUgw5Q1fLAcy4-t_AQ5rsPRY53WcGkahOf_zGCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS90ikA1CFVt825gVza5nQsfNa8NUYxTibbmurmUytMAw&oe=6AFC95D2"}, {"file_name": "META4(1).png", "id": "1746511323122669", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596149727_1746511326456002_2257129400968587855_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fFOpLY92mlIQ7kNvwGhSuom&_nc_oc=AdoEBOgp8aqVam6MzNzZQLzKNbjpOtP_IavHovVr5oemM08fwEUhyjuF-brEjdalJ7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqvx7xFnSp2LCXOnuZikvj7qheVxCFzuhh5DZwAQaNKg&oe=6AFC871E"}, {"file_name": "META2(1).png", "id": "1443665451164882", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1443665454498215_5898467597302138894_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lSsyuoZEdKsQ7kNvwHSWubZ&_nc_oc=AdrNssY91HmtJfu8N-v7WT-8ADz6ktZSv5S9Fbj9jLYb2dJ0EyqTwlhBvSxVdJelkS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTuiXsJkXcI-30q1d-byir9pBUFzORPyRJkgmWc293omA&oe=6AFC831A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Toy Store: Tidy Up Sorting Sim", "keywords": ["tidy", "sorting", "cleaning", "simulator", "dressmaker"], "long_description": "Toy Store: Tidy Up Sorting Sim \ud83e\uddf8\n\nWelcome to Toy Store: Tidy Up Sorting Sim, a cozy and satisfying game where your job is simple: sort toys, organize shelves, and keep your toy store looking perfect!\n\nStep into a colorful toy shop filled with adorable plushies, rubber ducks, dolls, action figures, and all kinds of toys waiting to be organized.\n\nWhether you love sorting games, tidy-up simulators, or simply enjoy putting everything in its perfect place, this relaxing experience is made for you!\n\n\ud83e\uddf8 Sort, Organize & Tidy Up!\n\nYour toy store is full of toys, but the shelves aren't going to organize themselves!\n\nPick up toys, sort them into their correct places, and transform messy shelves into beautifully organized displays. Every toy has its place, and it's up to you to find it!\n\n\ud83e\udd86 Sort Them Ducks!\n\nRubber ducks, teddy bears, dolls, and colorful toys are scattered throughout your shop.\n\nArrange them neatly, group similar toys together, and enjoy the satisfaction of turning clutter into order.\n\nFrom tiny ducks to adorable stuffed animals, there's always something that needs sorting!\n\n\ud83e\uddf9 A Cozy & Relaxing Sorting Experience\n\nForget stressful deadlines and complicated tasks. Take your time, enjoy the peaceful atmosphere, and experience the simple joy of tidying up.\n\nInspired by the satisfying feeling of organizing, cleaning, and sorting, Toy Store: Tidy Up Sorting Sim offers a relaxing escape for anyone who loves cozy games and become the ultimate dressmaker.", "short_description": "Welcome to Toy Store: Tidy Up Sorting Sim! A cozy and relaxing sorting game where you organize toys, tidy up shelves, and bring order to your very own toy shop. Sort colorful ducks, dolls, plushies, and more in this satisfying tidy-up simulator!"}]}, "developer_name": "MB Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MB Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/", "categor